  "description": "What better way to learn to ride a bike than with the most loveable and inexhaustible Blue Heeler, Bluey? The 12-inch Bluey Girl’s Bike by Dynacraft features a stylish metallic orange, green, and pink color scheme and is loaded with custom Bluey graphics. Bluey and little sister Bingo, along with neighborhood friends, adorn the eye-catching frame and chainguard. A cute pink and white star pattern on the handlebar grips and seat help transport young riders to the imaginative world of Bluey. This vibrant Bluey bike invites little riders to get outside for some riding and quality playtime with loved ones. Easy-to-use coaster brakes (just pedal backward) and removable training wheels make the ride smooth and controlled as little pups learn to ride. The 12-inch wheels make this a great option for children aged 3-5 years or 35” – 40” tall. Learning to ride has never felt so good as on Dynacraft's Bluey 12-inch Kids’ Bike.",
